        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Vienna\n- Organizations: Flex\n- People: High Contrast, Lincoln Barrett, Pendulum, DJ Marky, Aphrodite, Patifee, DJ Hype, Logistics, Leopoi\n- Topics: Drum and bass, electronic music\n\nFacts:\n- Flex is a nightclub in Vienna.\n- Flex has hosted hundreds of visits from drum and bass DJs including Pendulum, High Contrast, DJ Marky, Aphrodite, Patifee, DJ Hype, Logistics, and Leopoi.\n- Lincoln Barrett was born on 18 September 1979.\n- Lincoln Barrett is better known by the stage name High Contrast.\n- High Contrast is a Welsh electronic music producer, DJ, and record producer.",
